      "id": "S5-04",
      "shot": "S5-04",
      "text": "That's what the turntable is for. Picture one spoonful of soup riding around the plate. It drifts into a strong spot and heats up, slides through a weak one, then into another strong one — again and again. Turn after turn, the heating averages out.",
