      "shot": "S6-03",
      "text": "Part of it can be the dish. Some dishes let microwaves pass straight through, and only get warm from the food. Others absorb the energy themselves. Here's a simple test. Put the empty dish in next to a cup of water, and run it for one minute. Hot water and a cool dish? It's fine. If the dish is hot, it isn't microwave-safe.",
